@startuml SD-4a
!include ../_style.iuml
title SD-4a (Software level, CSMS) — Connector faulted, Operator acknowledges, remote reset, back to Available\nPrecondition: Charge Point in service · System view: AD-7 · State: STM-6, STM-2
footer Owner: Trần Trọng Nghĩa (WP4) · v2.0 · 01/11/2026 · names = code (apps/csms/src) · left gate = Charge Point / Operator Dashboard, right gate = Charge Point

participant "«component»\n<u>:OcppHandlers</u>" as H
participant "«component»\n<u>:SessionsService</u>" as S
participant "«component»\n<u>:FaultService</u>" as FS
participant "«component»\n<u>:ConsoleCommands</u>" as CC
participant "«component»\n<u>:ConnectionRegistry</u>" as REG

== Charge Point reports a fault ==
[-> H ++ : StatusNotification {connectorId, Faulted, errorCode} [OCPP 1.6J, WSS]
H -> S ++ : onStatusNotification(req, ctx)
S -> S : record status event, connector → Faulted
S --> H --
H -> FS ++ : onConnectorStatus({connector, Faulted, errorCode, occurredAt})
FS -> FS : no open fault → create fault,\nhide connector, alert Operator
hnote over FS : {fault.status = raised}
FS --> H --
[<-- H -- : StatusNotification.conf {}

== Operator acknowledges ==
[-> CC ++ : POST /api/admin/faults/{id}/acknowledge [HTTPS]
CC -> FS ++ : acknowledge(faultId, operatorId)
FS -> FS : raised → acknowledged
FS --> CC --
[<-- CC -- : 200

== Operator sends a remote reset ==
[-> CC ++ : POST /api/admin/faults/{id}/reset?type=Soft [HTTPS]
CC -> FS ++ : beginReset(faultId, {type}) : commandId
FS -> FS : acknowledged → resetting,\nstart 120 s reset timer
FS --> CC -- : commandId
CC -> FS ++ : markSent(commandId)
FS --> CC --
CC -> REG ++ : call(identity, Reset {type})
REG ->] : Reset [OCPP 1.6J, WSS]
REG <--] : Reset.conf {Accepted}
REG --> CC -- : Accepted
CC -> FS ++ : onResetResult(commandId, Accepted)
FS --> CC --
[<-- CC -- : 202 reset sent

== Charge Point restarts and reports Available ==
[-> H ++ : StatusNotification {connectorId, Available}
H -> S ++ : onStatusNotification(req, ctx)
S --> H --
H -> FS ++ : onConnectorStatus({connector, Available})
FS -> FS : resetting → resolved, clear timer,\nshow connector again
hnote over FS : {fault.status = resolved}
FS --> H --
[<-- H -- : StatusNotification.conf {}
note over H, REG : ConsoleCommands is the Iteration 1 operator API; the Operator Dashboard (WP4) will call the same FaultService operations.
@enduml
